    <track>
      <title>Massachusetts [U.K., Psyche, Pop, Lounge] (1982): This record is genuinely psychedelic. Consisting of only cover versions, Blacksmith slows each of them down to a glacial, dreamlike pace and layers the instruments individually to create a uniquely woozy, mind-altering sound.</title>
      <creator>Blacksmith</creator>
      <image>https://vintageobscura.net/yt_img/Rx6JZS68iS8.jpg</image>
      <album>Obscure Covers</album>
    </track>
